Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 11:29:07 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 04/13] @ Phase 3-4: Implement Qwen3VL vision encoder and main
 model

Phase 3 (qwen3vl_vision.py):
- Qwen3VLVisionPatchEmbed: Conv3D patch embedding (images + video)
- Qwen3VLVisionAttention: RoPE-based attention with FlashAttention no-pad
- Qwen3VLVisionBlock: LayerNorm + Attention + LayerNorm + MLP
- Qwen3VLVisionPatchMerger: Spatial merge + projection to LLM hidden size
- Qwen3VLVisionModel: ViT with DeepStack feature extraction
- Bilinear position embedding interpolation for arbitrary resolutions

Phase 4 (qwen3vl.py):
- Qwen3VLModel wrapper: vision encoder + Qwen3Model language model
- M-RoPE position encoding with 3D position_ids (T, H, W)
- get_rope_index: compute 3D positions for multimodal sequences
- DeepStack injection into early LLM layers
- masked_scatter for vision-text embedding fusion
- Modified Qwen3Model.forward() to support deepstack_visual_embeds

